                                                "sense_id": "8e54721e-d13e-3c44-af6d-b8819419f654",
                                                "text": "\"I have come to seek your counsel in your most ethel of ethical capacities. My problem is wholly mechanical.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c5f6f12-12c8-4cc6-bbc8-e48943343e77",
                                                "sense_id": "8e54721e-d13e-3c44-af6d-b8819419f654",
                                                "text": "The violation of an ethel born or noble woman was paid for by a higher murde than that of an un-ethel or common person. The murder of all persons was in like manner paid for by a were or were-geld, nicely adjusted to their relative rank."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "664cc2b4-a790-4de4-a862-243bef814105",
                                                "sense_id": "8e54721e-d13e-3c44-af6d-b8819419f654",
                                                "text": "[…] that he was of a doughty and ethel stirp. His ayle and eam had both been bellipotent; […]"
                                            }
